# Inner Sognefjord around Balestrand, where we spend a lot of time: from
# Vadheim and Høyanger in the west to Sogndal, Kaupanger and Molden in the
# east, and from the fjord's south side (where the Vikafjellet box starts)
# north past Fjærland, Gaularfjellet and the hills around Viksdalsvatnet
# and Haukedalsvatnet. No official boundary, so a box around Kartverket's
# place names. Much of it is fjord, which the N50 sea map lets the engine
# skip. EPSG:25833 metres, on the 2 km tile grid (1150 tiles).
WEST=4000
SOUTH=6800000
EAST=96000
NORTH=6850000
# N50 county files covering the box (Kartverket names), for the no-go areas.
N50_COUNTIES="46_Vestland"
